{"id":1833965,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-21T18:20:49.605Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1833965,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"CKY 5","overview":"Years after the CKY crew first started filming their reckless stunts and disgusting pranks, CKY 5 digs into the archives to unleash a huge collection of never‑before‑seen chaos from Bam Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, Raab Himself, and the rest of the West Chester misfits. Veterans of broken bones, rooftops, and terrible ideas, the crew returns through decades of lost tapes — remastered and assembled by longtime collaborator Zera Starcat, with help from dedicated fan archivists. What comes out is a raw mix of abandoned skits, Iceland misadventures, fake G.I. Joe insanity, Phil‑tormenting wake‑ups, drunken kitchen disasters, and the juvenile mayhem that defined CKY before Jackass hit MTV. Never officially released, CKY 5 survives through high‑quality fan rips, becoming a cult bootleg for anyone raised on extreme skating and early‑2000s stupidity.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":10575,"logo_path":null,"name":"Bam Margera Productions","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":69,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"CKY 5","video":true,"vote_average":10,"vote_count":1,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":56584,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Bam Margera","original_name":"Bam Margera","popularity":0.8151,"profile_path":"/4UiQ7FKhrwo0lUxBPPLZQSL2ZUb.jpg","cast_id":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6b00fd1c2a82133a793de022","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":117289,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Brandon DiCamillo","original_name